{"2786890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Perfect Castle", "steam_appid": 2786890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/a8c8d72dee540fa27085b11c86129fbf.poster.avif?t=1781594348\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/a8c8d72dee540fa27085b11c86129fbf.webm?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/a8c8d72dee540fa27085b11c86129fbf.mp4?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark fantasy interactive fiction RPG </strong>—<strong> explore a cruel medieval world where every click reveals more of the story, opens new paths, and changes what you become. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/80e00d066b3e23167760c6c623a83f1b.poster.avif?t=1781594348\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/80e00d066b3e23167760c6c623a83f1b.webm?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/80e00d066b3e23167760c6c623a83f1b.mp4?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Follow cursed paths, dead ruins, forgotten places, and whispers in the dark. What begins as a quiet journey through a hostile world slowly turns into something far more disturbing — a descent through fear, strange encounters, and choices that leave a mark.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/27807e3409a8556dfd528fc8292126e2.poster.avif?t=1781594348\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/27807e3409a8556dfd528fc8292126e2.webm?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/27807e3409a8556dfd528fc8292126e2.mp4?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark fantasy experience told through a blend of <strong>interactive fiction</strong>, <strong>visual novel storytelling</strong>, <strong>RPG progression</strong>, and <strong>clicker-style interaction</strong>. Click on objects, uncover hidden scenes, gain strength, and unlock new routes as the world opens piece by piece. Progress is not only about finding items — your actions shape what your character becomes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight creatures, explore eerie locations, gather cursed bones, improve your stats, and reveal new paths through a branching web of dangerous places. Some routes open through items. Others require strength, awareness, endurance, or choices made earlier. Each scene hides small decisions, grim encounters, and fragments of a larger mystery.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move deeper, the world changes — and so do you. Every click brings more light to the path, but not every discovery is safe. Some findings reward you. Others leave scars, open darker routes, or push you closer to madness.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a journey filled with oppressive atmosphere, unsettling discoveries, branching paths, sudden horror moments, and the constant feeling that something is waiting just outside the edge of sight.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy interactive fiction RPG in a cruel medieval world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel storytelling with point-and-click exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker-style progression where actions shape your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain stats and unlock new paths through strength, awareness, endurance, and choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cursed forests, dead ruins, caves, strange houses, and hidden routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritual battles shaped by cursed bones and desperate decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching paths, grim mini-stories, and a gradual descent into madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden horror moments and a disturbing dark fantasy atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/a8c8d72dee540fa27085b11c86129fbf.poster.avif?t=1781594348\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/a8c8d72dee540fa27085b11c86129fbf.webm?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2786890/extras/a8c8d72dee540fa27085b11c86129fbf.mp4?t=1781594348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark fantasy interactive fiction RPG </strong>—<strong> explore a cruel medieval world where every click reveals more of the story, opens new paths, and changes what you become. </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st