web of dangerous places. Some routes open through items. Others require strength, awareness, endurance, or choices made earlier. Each scene hides small decisions, grim encounters, and fragments of a larger mystery.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move deeper, the world changes — and so do you. Every click brings more light to the path, but not every discovery is safe. Some findings reward you. Others leave scars, open darker routes, or push you closer to madness.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a journey filled with oppressive atmosphere, unsettling discoveries, branching paths, sudden horror moments, and the constant feeling that something is waiting just outside the edge of sight.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy interactive fiction RPG in a cruel medieval world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel storytelling with point-and-click exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicker-style progression where actions shape your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain stats and unlock new paths through strength, awareness, endurance, and choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore cursed forests, dead ruins, caves, strange houses, and hidden routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritual battles shaped by cursed bones and desperate decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching paths, grim mini-stories, and a gradual descent into madness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden horror moments and a disturbing dark fantasy atmosphere</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A dark fantasy interactive fiction RPG in a cruel medieval world. Explore cursed paths, uncover grim encounters, grow through your actions, and face ritual battles shaped by cursed bones and desperate choices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<s